<LegalLayout title="Refund Policy" description="Apna Galla Refund Policy" lastUpdated="October 9, 2026">
  <p>At Apna Galla, we believe in transparent pricing and fair policies.</p>
  
  <h2>1. Subscription Cancellations</h2>
  <p>You can cancel your Apna Galla subscription at any time. Upon cancellation, your account will remain active until the end of your current billing cycle.</p>
  
  <h2>2. Refund Eligibility</h2>
  <p>Because we offer a free trial period, we do not generally offer refunds for payments already processed. If you believe you were charged in error, please contact our support team within 7 days of the charge.</p>
  
  <h2>3. Service Interruptions</h2>
  <p>In the rare event of prolonged, critical service unavailability, we may offer prorated credits at our sole discretion.</p>
</LegalLayout>
